	('9d539c6b-cc09-4c86-825a-1000cf49484a', '52d4f9cc-a6a1-4a2a-a8c3-6e56725be917', 'Landscaping Services of Douglas Brong at 35 Nandale Dr Buffalo , New York 14227 US', 'Roto till customer’s backyard starting from house to backyard fence.

